  # Fail-closed before mutation if atp cannot fund take>=1.
  # Distinct from effer (ATP->heat+n energy+n; thr held trophic cup), bleb (age+n reserve+n),
  # cad (thr+n DNA ladder), prime (ATP->thr- only, no heat), ease (heat->thr-, no ATP),
  # fortify (ATP->thr+), cool (heat leaves system). Continuum: ...->cad->bleb->effer->resolve.
  # Signature: heat+n thr-n; age+energy+reserve+pmf held — pro-resolve ease, not injury/trophic.
  # Usability: AGI models post-efferocytosis resolution / SPM program under ASSERT boards.
