  # Ready recomputed from post-burn energy vs threshold.
  # Continuum: ...->acidify->mature->recruit->activate->degrade->export->translate.
  # Signature: heat+n energy-n age-n pcr+n; reserve+thr+pmf+sp held — degrade life-force.
  # Usability: AGI models post-activate lysosomal substrate proteolysis under ASSERT.
  # Returns take clamped; dead/n<1/empty atp|energy -> 0.
  METHOD degrade n
    GETF THIS alive
