  # AGE/RESERVE/THRESHOLD/PMF/SETPOINT HELD — cleave is post-transloc peptide scission
  #   after Sec61 seated nascent chain, not anabolic age repair, not free-AA reserve
  #   spend, not hydrolase-latency thr, not EE proton bank, not secretory sp bank
  #   (already raised by transloc).
  # Ready recomputed from energy vs threshold after energy spend (quiescent forces 0).
  # Continuum: ...->export->translate->transloc->cleave->glycosyl->trim->cnx.
  # Signature: heat+n energy-n atp-n pcr+n; age+reserve+thr+pmf+sp held — cleave life-force.
  # Usability: AGI models post-transloc ER signal-peptidase maturation under ASSERT.
  # Returns take cleaved; dead/n<1/empty atp|energy -> 0.
  METHOD cleave n
    GETF THIS alive
    IF LAST_N == 0 THEN
      RET 0
